r_reconciler/snapshot_lagfree_refresh.py` module docstring cite \"ADR 0037 s3\" for the unbounded Jira DC reindex behavior, but ADR 0037 is `oss-contribution-intake-posture`. The cited support lives in `docs/adr/0055-jira-family-sub-seam.md` around line 282.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] The f449-era description/docstring reference no longer points readers to ADR 0037 for Jira DC reindex behavior.\n- [ ] `snapshot_lagfree_refresh.py` cites `docs/adr/0055-jira-family-sub-seam.md` (or ADR 0055) for the Jira-family sub-seam/reindex support.\n- [ ] Any related documentation wording remains consistent with the actual ADR titles and section content.\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"3e03-786b-cdc7-460b","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Fix f449 ADR citation for unbounded Jira DC reindex support","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["22d994fb-ceb0-4963-a0c2-e1dae12f5a8a","ad1a39f3-cd9c-4406-b3b8-e34eb1b69c2d"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788290882214274570,"uuid":"70613eab-5716-41b9-b2cb-277c671e7a9a"}